c Graph H_2 of Theorem 1 in 'The CLIQUES Algorithm Is Not Output-Polynomial' (Sec. 3)
c n = 2k^2+9k = 26 vertices (k = 2)
c maximal cliques upper bound: (k+1)(2k(k+3)+1) = 63
c guided calls lower bound: 2^(k+1)-1 = 7
c vertices: guards g_i = 1..2; core a_i = k+2i-1, b_i = k+2i (3..6); witnesses 7..26, 5 per core vertex
p edge 26 110
